//
// 3. Verify ASSOCIATED_WITH after step 2:
//
//    SELECT COUNT(*) FROM Account -(ASSOCIATED_WITH)-> Entity


// =============================================================================
// END OF LOADING JOBS
// =============================================================================
//
// NEXT STEPS
//   1. Confirm all SELECT COUNT(*) results match expected values above.
//   2. Run enrichment hooks (entity_type, ASSOCIATED_WITH) if needed.
//   3. Implement the GSQL traversal queries referenced in tigergraph_schema.gsql
//      Section 6 (get_account_subgraph, find_transfer_cycles, etc.).
//   4. Wire the traversal query outputs into
//      pipelines/graph_rag/generate_answer.py so subgraph context replaces
//      ChromaDB vector chunks as the LLM prompt evidence.
//   5. Add GraphRAG to experiments/run_benchmark.py PIPELINES list and run
//      the three-way benchmark: LLM-only vs Basic RAG vs GraphRAG.
